{ dg-modules "rcprelude" }
{ Rosetta Code, task "Old lady swallowed a fly", ALGOL 68 solution old-lady-swallowed-a-fly-1.alg.
  https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Old_lady_swallowed_a_fly#ALGOL_68
